# Content Security Policy
#
# Added 24 Nov 2026. CLAUDE.md had claimed for months that this file carried a
# CSP with no 'unsafe-inline' for scripts; it carried no CSP at all.
#
# script-src deliberately has NO 'unsafe-inline' — that is the whole value of
# the policy, and the codebase already earns it: zero inline event handlers,
# and quiz.html's one inline block was moved to quiz-bootstrap.js to get here.
# JSON-LD blocks are data, not executed, so they are unaffected.
#
# style-src DOES allow 'unsafe-inline', because ~70 style="..." attributes are
# spread through the markup. Inline styles cannot execute code; dropping this
# would mean rewriting that markup for very little security gain.
#
# Every origin below was taken from what the pages actually load:
#   browser.sentry-cdn.com   error tracking bundle (every page)
#   googletagmanager.com     gtag, loaded by analytics.js after consent
#   js.stripe.com            checkout.html
#   cdn.jsdelivr.net         settings.html (image cropper)
#   cdnjs.cloudflare.com     Font Awesome CSS + its font files
#   fonts.googleapis/gstatic Google Fonts
#   ingest.us.sentry.io      the DSN host in sentry-init.js
#   api. / staging-backend   the two API hosts api-service.js selects between
#   clarity.ms               Microsoft Clarity, loaded by cookie-consent.js
#                            ONLY after analytics consent — which is why a
#                            sweep that never accepts cookies will not see it
#
# If you add an external script, stylesheet, font or fetch target, add its
# origin here or it will be blocked. Check the browser console for
# "Refused to load" after any such change.

# Security headers for all pages
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://browser.sentry-cdn.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://js.stripe.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://www.clarity.ms; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https://api.thenursingcollective.pro https://staging-backend-production-365a.up.railway.app https://o4510760021590016.ingest.us.sentry.io https://www.google-analytics.com https://analytics.google.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://api.stripe.com https://www.clarity.ms https://*.clarity.ms; frame-src https://js.stripe.com; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

# Cache control for HTML pages
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Cache control for JavaScript files
/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

# Cache control for CSS files
/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

# Cache control for images
/*.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
